	  <h2 class="post-title" id="the-post-title">Pipilotti Rist: Pixel Forest and Worry Will Vanish</h2>
	  <div id="post-details-container" class="row">
	  <div id="post-details-left" class="col-xs-12">
	  <div class="box">
	  <p class="mansory-details">
	  	<span class="mansory-category"><a href="https://www.itsliquid.com/art" rel="category tag">Art</a></span> | August 22, 2017 | 
