	  <div class="the_post_content"> 
	  <p><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-41606 size-full" title="Pipilotti Rist: Pixel Forest and Worry Will Vanish" src="http://www.itsliquid.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Pipillotti_Rist_001.jpg" alt="Pipilotti Rist: Pixel Forest and Worry Will Vanish" width="648" height="432" srcset="https://www.itsliquid.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Pipillotti_Rist_001.jpg 648w, https://www.itsliquid.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Pipillotti_Rist_001-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.itsliquid.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Pipillotti_Rist_001-624x416.jpg 624w" sizes="(max-width: 648px) 100vw, 648px" /><sub>Image courtesy of the Museum of Fine Arts</sub></p>
<p><strong>Pipilotti Rist: Pixel Forest and Worry Will Vanish </strong><br />
 The Museum of Fine Arts, Huston<br />
 From 11 June to 17 September 2017</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">This summer, the MFAH continues its series of grand-scale, immersive exhibitions. <strong>Pipilotti Rist: Pixel Forest and Worry Will Vanish</strong> brings together two mesmerizing works newly acquired by the Museum. Under the direction of the artist, these light-based and video-based installations transform the vast, central gallery of Cullinan Hall into a <strong>cosmic journey</strong> through time and space.</p>
<p><span id="more-41049"></span></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p><img decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-41607 size-full" title="Pipilotti Rist: Pixel Forest and Worry Will Vanish" src="http://www.itsliquid.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Pipillotti_Rist_002.jpg" alt="Pipilotti Rist: Pixel Forest and Worry Will Vanish" width="648" height="432" srcset="https://www.itsliquid.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Pipillotti_Rist_002.jpg 648w, https://www.itsliquid.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Pipillotti_Rist_002-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.itsliquid.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/07/Pipillotti_Rist_002-624x416.jpg 624w" sizes="(max-width: 648px) 100vw, 648px" /></p>
<p><sub>Image courtesy of the Museum of Fine Arts</sub></p>
<p><div class="row middle-xs center-xs beetween-xs social-sharing-row">



	<div class="col-xs-2"><div class="box">



	<!-- Sharingbutton Facebook -->



	<a href="https://facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=https://www.itsliquid.com/pipilotti-rist-pixel-forest-and-worry-will-vanish.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="">



