	</a>



	</div></div>



	<div class="col-xs-2"><div class="box">



	<!-- Sharingbutton E-Mail -->



	<a href="mailto:?subject=Pipilotti Rist: Pixel Forest and Worry Will Vanish&amp;body=https://www.itsliquid.com/pipilotti-rist-pixel-forest-and-worry-will-vanish.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="">



		<i class="social-sharing-widget fas fa-envelope-square"></i>



